  "about": {
    "title": "About Pure Life",
    "subtitle": "A Team of Specialized Experts",
    "paragraph1": "Pure Life Company is a group of specialists in the world of air conditioning, refrigeration, water treatment, and environmental technology inside and outside Egypt for more than 15 years. We decided to establish Pure Life based on modern concepts relying on market study, meeting its requirements, and addressing drawbacks using scientific foundations and international standards. Through research, we found that exceptional after-sales service is the primary guarantee for corporate progress.",
    "paragraph2": "Because we aspire not just to be distinctive but to be the best, we realized our path begins with pre-sales service followed by after-sales service. We carefully selected the most efficient air conditioners, water filters, and heavy-weight brand products to support our vision, refusing to compromise on low-efficiency equipment regardless of profitability.",
    "quoteBoxText": "Since your trust is our ultimate goal, we leverage our scientific and practical expertise to serve you with utmost dedication...",
    "quoteBoxFooter": "Our Expertise is Our Past... Our Service is Our Present... Your Trust is Our Future"
  },
